    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried testing their sugar but the meter is being really finicky and giving weird readings. they're also acting really out of it and their breath smells kind of funny.. like fruit or nail polish or something? i don't want to go to the er if it's just a spike, it's so expensive and they're probably fine if they just rest and keep hydrating. do you think it's okay to just let them sleep for a few hours and check on them later?",
