      "content": "okay but they literally just fell asleep. they seem really comfortable though, not like they're in pain or anything. i'm just really stressed about the hospital bill and they always say they feel better after a nap. like, if i just give them some insulin now to bring the sugar down and let them sleep, wouldn't that be safer than driving them to the hospital in this state? they're breathing okay, just really heavy. can i just handle this at home?",
